        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hp-legend" parent="hp-root1" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;Arrows&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━▶&lt;/b&gt; HTTP API call (future REST endpoint)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;- - -▷&lt;/b&gt; HTTP response&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d6792b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━▶&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; ⚡ socket.io event&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#3d5a99&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;- - -▶&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Stripe (Stripe.js, webhook, API)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Socket rooms&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;order:{id} · restaurant:{id} · courier:{id} · admin&lt;br&gt;conversation:{id} · user:{id}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Courier position&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The courier app reports its own position (M2, M19).&lt;br&gt;Demos use a courier-simulator script.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;order.updated payload&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;{id, status, dispatchState, courierId, eta, version}&lt;br&gt;Clients ignore events with an older version.&lt;br&gt;Every order.updated is also sent to the admin room.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;References&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;T- and S-numbers = docs/design/notes/order-state-machine.md.&lt;br&gt;Each status change commits first; socket events and Stripe calls go out through the outbox.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Endpoint paths and event names are proposals.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="490" width="330" x="1430" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
